1
00:00:00,222 --> 00:00:03,062
(Raj:)And you think
that's going to help?
Yes.

2
00:00:03,059 --> 00:00:05,689
(Howard:)Well, I don't think
that's gonna help at all.

3
00:00:05,695 --> 00:00:07,065
(Sheldon:)Oh, no, it will.

4
00:00:07,063 --> 00:00:10,703
(Sheldon:)See, by keeping my mind engaged,
I'll become more focused.

5
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:12,870
(Leonard:)Howard's right--
that'll never work.

6
00:00:12,868 --> 00:00:14,698
(Sheldon:)Stop fighting me on the premise.

7
00:00:14,704 --> 00:00:16,274
(Sheldon:)It's scientifically valid.

8
00:00:16,272 --> 00:00:17,702
(Sheldon:)I'm going to advance
propositions,

9
00:00:17,707 --> 00:00:19,407
(Sheldon:)I just want you to challenge me.

10
00:00:19,408 --> 00:00:22,108
(Howard:)I don't think that's
what you want at all.

11
00:00:23,279 --> 00:00:24,879
(Sheldon:)Why, of course it's what I want.

12
00:00:24,880 --> 00:00:27,580
(Sheldon:)Why would I say it's what I want
if it's not what I want?

13
00:00:27,583 --> 00:00:30,653
(Leonard:)Because it is what you want,
and it's not what you said.

14
00:00:32,622 --> 00:00:35,222
(Sheldon:)I ask you for one simple thing,
and you can't even do it.

15
00:00:35,224 --> 00:00:36,724
(Howard:)Yes, we can.
Yeah, well, then do it.

16
00:00:36,726 --> 00:00:38,296
(Howard:)Nah.

17
00:00:39,261 --> 00:00:41,031
(Sheldon:)You guys are the worst.

18
00:00:43,599 --> 00:00:46,129
(Sheldon:)Thank you,
I think that was helpful.

19
00:00:51,273 --> 00:00:54,073
(Penny:)So, whichever rep has
the best sales for the quarter

20
00:00:54,076 --> 00:00:55,576
(Penny:)gets a trip for two to Hawaii.

21
00:00:55,578 --> 00:00:58,278
(Amy:)That would be so romantic
for you and Leonard.

22
00:00:58,280 --> 00:01:00,750
(Penny:)Yeah, clearly you haven't
seen him on the beach

